{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $10h+30+50j$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $5$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}10h+30+50j\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5\\left(\\dfrac{10h+30+50j}{5}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5\\left(\\dfrac{10h}{5}+\\dfrac{30}{5}+\\dfrac{50j}{5}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=5(2h+6+10j)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $10h+30+50j$ is *not* equivalent to $5(2h+30+50j)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $10$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}10h+30+50j\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10\\left(\\dfrac{10h+30+50j}{10}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10\\left(\\dfrac{10h}{10}+\\dfrac{30}{10}+\\dfrac{50j}{10}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=10(h+3+5j)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $10h+30+50j$ is equivalent to $10(h+3+5j)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}10h+30+50j\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{10h+30+50j}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{10h}{2}+\\dfrac{30}{2}+\\dfrac{50j}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(5h+15+25j)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $10h+30+50j$ is equivalent to $2(5h+15+25j)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $15$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}10h+30+50j\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=15\\left(\\dfrac{10h+30+50j}{15}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=15\\left(\\dfrac{10h}{15}+\\dfrac{30}{15}+\\dfrac{50j}{15}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=15\\left(\\dfrac{2}{3}h+2+\\dfrac{10}{3}j\\right)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $10h+30+50j$ is *not* equivalent to $15(10h+2+50j)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $10h+30+50j$:\n\n- $10(h+3+5j)$\n- $2(5h+15+25j)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $10h+30+50j$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $10h+150+250j$.","content":"$5(2h+30+50j)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $10h+30+50j$.","content":"$10(h+3+5j)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $10h+30+50j$.","content":"$2(5h+15+25j)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $150h+30+750j$.","content":"$15(10h+2+50j)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
